CursedFlameNodeMB: {
	DisplayName: Cursed Flame Node
	BestiaryEntry1: A defense mechanism created by the corruption in response to its waning ability to spread after the felling of plantera. It stays idle, empowering enemies nearby to allow them to better defend the hive from invaders. If attacked, it will snap into action to join in defending the hive.
}

